{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miyuuri's Cozy Hours</strong> is a compact, gamified focus tool designed to enhance concentration and reduce stress. Through features such as fishing, customizing your own space, character outfit changes, flow state tools, letter writing, and pet companionship, it helps make real life more fulfilling and enjoyable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Cozy Nook</strong>  <br>Change wallpapers, furniture, and wall decorations to create your ideal 2D cozy space!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.poster.avif?t=1759940609\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.webm?t=1759940609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/d1797716daec2d2ba8dd2603921e79f2.mp4?t=1759940609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide selection of clothing, hairstyles, accessories, and customizations to create a style you love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/348e2c1b700e50616cccad5711a18a8f.poster.avif?t=1759940609\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/348e2c1b700e50616cccad5711a18a8f.apng?t=1759940609\" class=\"bb_img\" width=478 height=223 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing &amp; Fishkeeping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy simple fishing and keep your caught fish at the bottom of your screen! Adorable pets will keep you company too! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/a19211be8894a45e7062c4ee47aa72fe.poster.avif?t=1759940609\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/a19211be8894a45e7062c4ee47aa72fe.webm?t=1759940609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/\u98ce\u6c34\u9c7c.gif?t=1759940609\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/extras/\u5f88\u591a\u867e.gif?t=1759940609\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Music &amp; Sounds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 80+ carefully selected tracks and 30+ white noises including temple bells, wooden fish, and heartbeat sounds, find the perfect background ambiance for work, study, or relaxation! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flow Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused and efficient with Miyuri: Pomodoro timer, habit tracker, priority sticky notes, calendar\u2026 complete your daily goals in a warm and comforting atmosphere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letters to Afar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write a letter and send it to an unknown destination. Perhaps one day, you'll receive a sincere reply from a stranger or read a heartwarming story!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831230?t=1759940609","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackg