lls, wooden fish, and heartbeat sounds, find the perfect background ambiance for work, study, or relaxation! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flow Tools</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused and efficient with Miyuri: Pomodoro timer, habit tracker, priority sticky notes, calendar\u2026 complete your daily goals in a warm and comforting atmosphere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Letters to Afar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write a letter and send it to an unknown destination. Perhaps one day, you'll receive a sincere reply from a stranger or read a heartwarming story!</p></li></ul>","developers":["boatonthelake"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/d5dfbca49bd3d5a84148930f3eea11e4cc32687b/header.jpg?t=1759940609","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Miyuuri's Cozy Hours","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 350 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 350 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["boatonthelake"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831230/3bd4bddea6abe1cc96d481f4c8518adb2fe3e2b5/ss_3bd4bddea6abe1cc96d481f4c8518adb2fe3e2b5.1920x1080.jpg?t